        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">No hidden charges apply. The freight tariff presented includes base distance fare, fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and any optional services you select. All taxes, tolls, and regulatory fees are disclosed upfront, ensuring complete pricing transparency from quote to final invoice.</p>
